{"id":"n51887-8-2","stage":0,"title":"또 · 还","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n51887-8-2-1","ko":"부장님이 앞에 나와서 노래 부르라는데?","zh":"部长说让你到前面唱歌呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부장님이","meaning":"部长","explanation":"부장：部长；님：尊称后缀；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부장","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59737","senseId":"1","lemma":"부장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부장님이","audio":"/audio/406e95ae8d8b0f67e78a.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面；-에 标记位置，앞에 是“到前面”。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}},{"text":"나와서","meaning":"走到前面","explanation":"나오다：从里面出来；-아서 连接后续动作，앞에 나와서 指“走到前面去”。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"1","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나와서","audio":"/audio/0fa3938955583182ca19.mp3"}},{"text":"노래","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}},{"text":"부르라는데?","meaning":"唱歌","explanation":"부르다：唱；-(으)라는데 转述命令并带出对方的反应。这里是部长让对方到前面唱歌。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"4","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부르라는데","audio":"/audio/42aa2a02e4c7f921ac2a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"01b3143b55839388","term":"부장","zh":"部长","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3","entryId":"59737","definition":"在机关、组织中负责管理一个部门的职位；或指在这个职位的人。","pronunciation":["부장"]